      "name": "Primary Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "品牌主色实心按钮，hover 走灯色阶变亮；EP 默认尺寸。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-primary\">主要操作</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-primary { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 32px; padding: 8px 15px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1; color: #fff; background: var(--color-primary, #409eff); border: none; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; transition: background-color 150ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), box-shadow 150ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1); } .ds-btn-primary:hover { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-primary, #409eff) 80%, #ffffff); } .ds-btn-primary:active { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-primary, #409eff) 90%, #000000); } .ds-btn-primary:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-primary, #409eff) 60%, #ffffff); outline-offset: 2px; }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Default Input",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "",
      "description": "EP 默认输入框：白底灰框，focus 转主色描边。",
      "html": "<input class=\"ds-input\" placeholder=\"请输入\" />",
      "css": ".ds-input { height: 32px; padding: 0 12px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 32px; color: var(--text-primary, #303133); background: var(--bg-base, #ffffff); border: 1px solid var(--border-base, #dcdfe6); border-radius: 4px; outline: none; transition: border-color 150ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), box-shadow 150ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1); } .ds-input::placeholder { color: var(--text-placeholder, #c0c4cc); } .ds-input:hover { border-color: var(--text-placeholder, #c0c4cc); } .ds-input:focus { border-color: var(--color-primary, #409eff); box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-primary, #409eff) 20%, transparent); }"
    },
    {
